A. Commit message:
Backport blk-mq and blk-sysfs fixes for older kernel version

B. Change summary:
This patch backports changes from the newer version of the Linux kernel to address issues in the block layer, specifically in `blk-mq-sysfs.c`, `blk-mq.c`, and `blk-sysfs.c`. The changes include ensuring proper locking mechanisms, fixing request queue handling, and updating sysfs entry functions.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Medium: Code diff will be applied and a pull request will be sent to the developer to merge, but there are no indirect changes expected to be done in other parts of the system.

D. Fixed Code:
```diff
diff --git a/block/blk-mq-sysfs.c b/block/blk-mq-sysfs.c
--- a/block/blk-mq-sysfs.c
+++ b/block/blk-mq-sysfs.c
